## Stack

This project follows the Lixali Studio conventions:

- **Frontend:** React 18/19 + Vite (web apps); Astro (marketing sites, blogs, landing pages)
- **Backend:** Elysia (default), Hono, or NestJS
- **Runtime:** Cloudflare Pages (frontends), Cloudflare Workers (light backends, MVPs)
- **Database:** Cloudflare D1 + Drizzle (default on Workers); Supabase PostgreSQL when needed
- **Auth:** Supabase Auth for simple auth; Better Auth for B2B, API keys, multi-provider, or fine-grained permissions
- **Workflows:** Inngest (async jobs, scheduled functions, webhooks)
- **Object storage:** Cloudflare R2
- **Architecture:** NestJS-inspired structure (modules, controllers, services, repositories, factories)
- **Observability:** Sentry (errors), Axiom (logs), Better Stack (uptime/alerting)
- **Alternative targets:** AWS or custom VPS via Shipnode (`deploy-to-vps`) when Cloudflare is not suitable

